    "chunk_text": "lugubria mortifera mortalia tristia noxia luctuosa uel deriendlican re\u00felican. Fera scilicet dicitur pila a ferendo uel feriendo uel inpatiens atrox pessima uel sinulira uel bog. Feranea .i.circumferentia. Feraces glebas .i.fertiles \u00fea w\u00e6stmb\u00e6re tyrf. Ferax .i.fertilis uel nomen animalis.Feram .i.sustineam sinam patiar deducam obtulero do tribuo Ferratas acies \u00fea isnodan truman. Feracior .i.durior uel fertilior. Ferale monstrum re\u00felic scinhiw. Feralis bestia re\u00fee nyten. Ferratos thoros fortes scapulos uel brachias. Fer .i.sustine. Ferres .i.sustinebas \u00feu \u00feoladest contuleras. Ferre .i.sustinere portare tolerare subsistere dare durare pati offerre figere. Fere .i.admodum prope aliquoties pene forte uel re\u00fea. Fereatis .i.quietis restendum securis. Feres .i.accipies portas tribuis uel toleres adnunties.Ferebatur .i.narrabatur dicebatur. Ferentes .i.sustinentes tolerantes uel offerentes. Ferunt .i.portant fatentur prebent sustinent dicunt uel for\u00feyldia\u00fe urgatur bringa\u00fe. Ferendus .i.praeponendus. Ferent .i.portent tollent.Ferebat .i.sustinebat dicebat portabat. Ferrugo .i.color purpure sub nigrae isengr\u00e6g uel ferrugineus. Ferrugenas pallidas. Ferruginem .i.",
